46
00:33:26.000 --> 00:34:07.000
This meeting also provided police with the opportunity to run Dahlia's license plates through their system in order to confirm her husband's identity. On Monday, August 3, an undercover officer from Boynton Beach Police Department's community action team called Dahlia to pose as the hitman. Officer Widdie Jean was selected for the role because he was a black man with cornrows in his hair, which likely matched the image Dahlia had of a hitman, based on her previous encounters with the Buck Wilde gang. Officer Jean told Dahlia he was driving up from Miami and would call again to arrange

