00:41:06.000 --> 00:41:56.000
investigators that Dahlia didn't want to risk having her possession stolen as part of the ruse. After Dahlia was placed under arrest for solicitation to commit murder, Sergeant Sheridan informed her that the hitman she'd hired was in fact an undercover officer. In the convertible when you sat his car in the front of CVS, what do you want to do? What do you want to do here? Dahlia, listen to me. I didn't do anything. You're going to jail. I didn't do anything.

