00:41:56.000 --> 00:42:17.000
Please, I didn't do anything. Tell me you didn't do anything. I didn't do anything. You're going to jail today. As soon as I'm done, they're going to come in here and handcuff you and take you to the Palm Beach County Jail, book you for solicitation of first-degree murder on your husband. Your husband is well and alive. Thank God.

59
00:42:17.000 --> 00:42:36.000
Oh, yeah, thank God. Can I see him? Can I see him? No, he doesn't want to see you. I'm so happy to see him. When Sergeant Sheridan revealed that Michael was alive and well, Dahlia immediately asked to see him. Investigators initially refused her request,

